霍华德先邀他去住他家  还算好兄弟吗
that Howard offers him a place to live first?

24
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:13,230
你还是个更棒的老公
You're an even better husband.

25
00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:18,730
我知道如果是换作我落魄  他一定会伸出援手
I know if the roles were reversed,he would do it for me.

26
