听起来好惨啊
That sounds awful.

31
00:01:30,870 --> 00:01:32,290
希望他也会这么觉得
Let's hope he thinks so, too.

32
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:39,290
我再说一次  绿巨人  蝙蝠侠  任何真人大小人像都不行
For the last time, no Hulk, no Batman, no life-size statues.

33
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:41,050
哇哦
Wow.

34
00:01:41,210 --> 00:01:44,720
我开始觉得其实你并不是真心想要布置一下家里
I'm starting to think you didn't mean it when you said you wanted to spruce up the place.

35
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,420
生

36
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,420
活

37
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,420
大

38
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,420
爆

