虽然条件不太理想
I know it's not ideal,

48
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:36,600
但好歹里面有很多空间放你的家具
but you'd have plenty of space for your furniture,

49
00:02:36,770 --> 00:02:40,480
还有个很酷的按钮  能让你其中一面"墙"卷起来又放下去呢
and there's this cool button that makes an entire wall go up and down.

50
00:02:41,310 --> 00:02:43,650
真是太感谢你了
I cannot thank you enough.

51
00:02:43,820 --> 00:02:45,610
能帮你我们也很高兴
It is our pleasure.

52
