霍华德  车库里的无线网信号如何
Hey, Howard, uh, how's the Wi-Fi in the garage?

70
00:03:45,340 --> 00:03:48,170
我也不知道  你为啥要问这么多问题啊
I don't know. Why are you asking all these questions?

71
00:03:48,630 --> 00:03:50,550
老实告诉你  莱纳德也在跟我通话
Well, to be honest, Leonard's on the other line,

72
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:52,510
他邀请我去住他家那间空房
and he offered me their spare bedroom.

73
