佩妮  住住住  麻烦您了
Oh, uh, hi, Penny. Yes, please.

83
00:04:19,540 --> 00:04:20,540
-嘿  -嗨
-Hey.  -Hi.

84
00:04:20,710 --> 00:04:23,670
佩妮  这张传单是给"住户"的
Uh, Penny, this circular is addressed to "Occupant,"

85
00:04:23,830 --> 00:04:27,210
但是我们现在换着住  我弄不太清是给你还是给我的
but with our apartment switch,it's unclear whether it's yours or mine.

86
00:04:27,380 --> 00:04:29,050
-是干嘛的传单  -铺屋顶
-What's it for?  -Roofing.

87
00:04:29,210 --> 00:04:30,420
那肯定是你的了
Yeah, it's yours.

88
00:04:32,010 --> 00:04:33,220
好吧  谢谢
Okay, thanks.

89
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,100
"直接扔了吧"
"Just throw it out."

90
00:04:37,220 --> 00:04:38,890
说到住户
