91
00:04:39,060 --> 00:04:42,350
根据我听到的消息  拉杰会搬到我以前的房间
I'm given to understand Raj will be moving into my old room.

92
00:04:42,520 --> 00:04:43,810
是啊  暂住一阵
Yeah, for a little while.

93
00:04:43,980 --> 00:04:44,980
那他的狗呢
What about his dog?

94
00:04:45,150 --> 00:04:47,270
她会住在她的笼子里  问题不大
She'll be in her crate; it's not a big deal.

95
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:48,940
那我还算能接受吧
I suppose that's acceptable.

96
00:04:49,230 --> 00:04:50,740
谢尔顿现在比较敢接近狗了
Well, Sheldon's getting a little better with dogs.

97
00:04:50,940 --> 00:04:53,150
他这次还在迪士尼乐园跟布鲁托合照了呢
He even took a picture with Pluto at Disneyland.

98
00:04:54,740 --> 00:04:57,410
如果真的狗也会送我胸章  那我也喜欢他们
If real dogs gave me buttons, I'd like them, too.

99
00:04:59,370 --> 00:05:02,750
我觉得你们愿意帮助朋友是一件很棒的事
Well, I think it's very nice that you're helping out our friend.

100
00:05:02,910 --> 00:05:04,120
我倒觉得你也很棒
I think it's nice that you're taking

101
