这话是什么意思
And what is that supposed to mean?

103
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:12,630
这就跟某个科学定律一样
Well, it's like that science thing.

104
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:16,220
有任何举动[作用] 你都会有又大又烦人的反应[反作用]
For every action,you have a gigantic and annoying reaction.

105
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:20,720
真想不到我老婆美貌与智慧并存啊
Just when I thought you couldn't get any hotter.

106
00:05:22,640 --> 00:05:23,770
如果你俩是暗示
If you're implying

107
00:05:23,940 --> 00:05:27,270
我会不爽拉杰搬进我的房间  那你们就错了
that I'd have some problem with him moving into my room, you're wrong.

108
