药量不需要调整  你做得很好
Do not adjust the dosage. You nailed it.

111
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,410
别听他们胡说
Don't listen to them.

112
00:05:39,870 --> 00:05:42,790
奇怪的是佩妮居然差点就说对了一个科学事实
What's weird is that Penny almost got a science fact right.

113
