错  当时我们站在我房间外的走廊
Wrong.We were standing outside my room in the hallway.

126
00:06:18,660 --> 00:06:21,160
这就是我刚说到的爱
And there is the love of which I speak.

127
00:06:21,830 --> 00:06:23,120
我知道这样很不理性
I realize it's irrational,

128
00:06:23,290 --> 00:06:26,580
但拉杰的入住让我觉得自己被取代了
but with Raj moving in there, I'm feeling a bit replaced.

129
