现在对他来说是困难时期
Well, this isn't an easy time for him.

130
00:06:30,340 --> 00:06:34,710
他公寓没了  还欠了一屁股债  他可能正羞愧难当呢
He's losing his apartment, he's in debt,he's probably humiliated.

131
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,800
是啊  可能
Yes, probably.

132
00:06:36,970 --> 00:06:39,890
但在确定之前  我该怎么才能舒坦呢
But until we know for sure, how can I feel better?

133
00:06:42,010 --> 00:06:43,680
你们谁还需要什么吗
Can I get anyone anything at all?

134
