拉杰  你不用服务我们
Raj, you don't have to serve us.

135
00:06:45,350 --> 00:06:48,020
这是我该做的  谢谢你们帮我搬我的家当上楼
It's the least I can do for helping me carry my stuff up.

136
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:50,020
真的没什么大不了的
It was really no problem.

137
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:52,610
对你来说当然啦  你只搬了一箱毛巾
Not for you, Box of Towels.

138
00:06:54,980 --> 00:06:56,030
总而言之  谢谢你们
Anyway, thanks again.

139
00:06:56,190 --> 00:06:59,200
瞧瞧  你们有拉杰  我们有斯图尔特
Hey, look at that. You've got a Raj, we've got a Stuart.

140
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:03,200
或许我们该带他俩去公园  让他们一起撒欢跑跑
Maybe we should take them both to the park and let them run around together.

141
