我不知道  你那只看起来身上有虫子
I don't know. Yours looks like he has worms.

142
00:07:09,500 --> 00:07:11,330
-可以走了吗  -一切准备妥当
-You ready to go?  -All set.

143
00:07:11,880 --> 00:07:15,210
-那是什么  -给拉杰的乔迁礼物
-What's that?  -A housewarming gift for Raj.

144
00:07:16,010 --> 00:07:18,090
最好不是一大堆假蛇突然从里面冒出来
Well, a bunch of fake snakes better not spring out of it,

145
00:07:18,260 --> 00:07:20,550
因为那是一份超烂的纪念日礼物
'cause that was a lousy anniversary present.

146
00:07:21,850 --> 00:07:23,350
绝对不会
It's nothing like that.

147
00:07:23,510 --> 00:07:27,270
我考虑到拉杰现在的情况  于是我改变了主意
I just, I thought about Raj's situation,and I had a change of heart.

148
00:07:27,430 --> 00:07:31,440
至于你的礼物  是你自己说"给我惊喜"  而我的确"惊"到你了
You know, and regarding your gift,you said "Surprise me," and, boy, did I.

149
00:07:34,440 --> 00:07:35,570
-哈喽  -嗨
- Hello.  - Hi.

150
00:07:35,730 --> 00:07:36,820
时间刚刚好  食物都准备好了
Perfect timing. Food's ready.

151
00:07:36,990 --> 00:07:38,110
等等  在开吃之前  我有一份小小的
Uh, wait-- before we eat, I have a little

152
00:07:38,280 --> 00:07:40,990
"欢迎入住"礼物要给拉杰
"Welcome to the building" gift for Raj.

153
00:07:41,280 --> 00:07:43,580
-慢着  是不是会蹦出什么...   -不是  我问过了
-Wait, is anything gonna jump out...  -No. I already asked.

154
00:07:45,450 --> 00:07:46,700
谢谢  谢尔顿
Thank you, Sheldon.

155
00:07:48,250 --> 00:07:50,080
是一本...空白的笔记本
It's a... blank notebook.

156
00:07:50,710 --> 00:07:54,420
我曾在那个房间里想出过不少好点子  我相信你也会的
Well, I had some of my best ideas in that room, and I'm sure you will, too.

157
00:07:54,590 --> 00:07:57,760
他也未曾在那个房间里做过爱呢  那是另一件值得期盼的事情啊
He also never had sex in that room.That's something else to look forward to.

158
00:08:01,090 --> 00:08:02,090
这对我来说意义重大
This means a lot.

159
00:08:02,260 --> 00:08:04,140
我知道现在对你来说是困难时期
Well, I know this is a difficult time for you.

160
00:08:04,300 --> 00:08:06,600
你的公寓没了  还欠了一屁股债
Y-You're losing your apartment, you're in debt,

161
00:08:06,760 --> 00:08:08,600
你可能...肯定羞愧难当吧
and you just-- you must be humiliated.

162
00:08:08,890 --> 00:08:09,980
谢尔顿
Sheldon...

163
00:08:10,140 --> 00:08:14,360
哎呀  老天  她真爱拘泥于细节  非得注明出处  那些都是艾米的原话
Oh, good grief. She is such a stickler for citing sources.Those were Amy's words.

164
00:08:16,270 --> 00:08:17,860
-谢尔顿  -我知道  我知道
-Sheldon...  -I know, I know!

165
00:08:18,030 --> 00:08:20,530
"哎呀  老天"是查理·布朗的原话  真是够了
"Good grief" was originally said by Charlie Brown, geez.

166
00:08:18,030 --> 00:08:20,530
美国著名漫画《史努比》里的主人公，他犯错或是遇到难题时的口头禅

167
00:08:22,610 --> 00:08:24,280
你说得对  我是羞愧难当
You're right, I am humiliated.

168
00:08:24,450 --> 00:08:26,700
多谢当面指出来  你真是个混蛋
Thanks for pointing it out.You're such a jerk.

169
00:08:27,790 --> 00:08:28,950
你们能相信他居然这么说我吗
Can you believe this guy?

170
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:30,460
能
Yes.

171
00:08:32,040 --> 00:08:34,790
我还以为会听到另一种答案呢
I-I thought that was gonna break the other way.

172
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:37,170
走吧  谢尔顿  或许我们应该回自己公寓吃饭
Come on, Sheldon. Maybe we should just eat at our place.

173
00:08:37,500 --> 00:08:38,590
好吧
Fine.

174
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:40,130
你占了我的房间
You took my room.

175
00:08:40,380 --> 00:08:42,800
你还让我的朋友跟我翻脸  现在你开心啦
You turned my friends against me.I hope you're happy.

176
00:08:43,010 --> 00:08:45,260
我有什么值得开心的  我的人生一团糟
What do I have to be happy about? My life's a wreck.

177
00:08:46,140 --> 00:08:47,260
为什么他可以说出来  而我却不能
How come he can say it and I can't?

178
00:08:47,430 --> 00:08:48,510
快走吧你
Just keep walking.

179
00:08:56,560 --> 00:09:00,490
你好呀  谢尔顿  真是意外之喜呀  你好吗
Hello, Sheldon. What a pleasant surprise.How are you?

180
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:03,030
老实说  不是太好
Honestly, I've been better.

181
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:06,320
你有时间吗  莱纳德说你最近很忙
Do you have time? Leonard says you're very busy these days.

182
00:09:06,700 --> 00:09:08,660
我这么说是因为他会喋喋不休
Oh, I just say that because he prattles.

183
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:12,080
发生什么事了
What's going on?

184
00:09:12,370 --> 00:09:16,000
我们的朋友拉杰搬进了我的旧房间
Well, our friend Raj moved into my old room,

185
00:09:16,170 --> 00:09:19,590
这事导致我产生了很多负面情绪
and it's brought up a lot of negative feelings for me.

186
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:23,550
你觉得失去你的旧房间代表了什么
Well, what do you think the loss of your room represents?

187
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:26,140
贝弗利  你知道我十分敬重你
Beverly, you know I hold you in high esteem.

188
00:09:26,300 --> 00:09:28,470
我们可以跳过你假装不知道答案的戏码
Can we skip the part where you pretend not to know the answer,

189
00:09:28,640 --> 00:09:30,680
直接进入你告诉我答案的环节吗
and get to the part where you tell me the answer?

190
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:36,520
好的  但你不介意的话  为了戏剧化效果  我还是要停顿一下
Very well, but, uh, if you don't mind,I'd still like to pause for effect.

191
00:09:38,110 --> 00:09:39,230
现在嘛...
Now...

192
00:09:41,150 --> 00:09:44,740
你最近和福勒博士同居了  对吧
You've recently moved in with Dr. Fowler, yes?

193
00:09:44,900 --> 00:09:46,110
没错
I have.

194
00:09:46,450 --> 00:09:49,740
显然你的旧房间代表了一个逃生出口
Clearly, your old room represents an escape hatch,

195
00:09:49,910 --> 00:09:51,870
倘若失去了这出口  你就将被迫面对
and without it, you're forced to confront

196
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:57,040
和艾米永远生活在一起的可怕现实
the terrifying reality of being trapped in a relationship with Amy forever.

197
00:09:58,920 --> 00:10:00,090
我从未想过这问题
I hadn't thought about that.

198
00:10:00,250 --> 00:10:02,340
现在也别开始想
And don't start thinking about it now!

199
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:05,760
你好呀  艾米
Hello, Amy.

200
00:10:06,220 --> 00:10:09,100
你的这种防御表现似乎也在暗示
Your defensiveness may indicate similar insecurities

201
00:10:09,260 --> 00:10:11,100
你对于这份感情有同样的不安全感
about your relationship with Sheldon.

202
00:10:11,390 --> 00:10:12,390
才不是这样的
That's not true!

203
00:10:12,680 --> 00:10:14,060
她极具防御性地说
She said defensively.

204
00:10:16,890 --> 00:10:18,270
这不是关于我和谢尔顿的问题
This isn't about me and Sheldon.

205
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:21,440
而是拉杰要搬去和莱纳德还有佩妮一起住
This is about Rajesh moving in with Leonard and Penny.

206
00:10:21,900 --> 00:10:23,610
有点意思
Interesting.

207
00:10:23,900 --> 00:10:27,450
他们发现自己需要再找一个室友了
They've found a need to take yet another roommate.

208
00:10:28,110 --> 00:10:31,080
看来他们也在努力回避二人世界中的残酷现实呀
Seems they're avoiding some harsh realities themselves.

209
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:35,910
我真没想到我们这些人的感情生活都是一团乱麻
I had no idea all our relationships were such a disaster.

210
00:10:36,210 --> 00:10:37,210
唉呀妈呀  你可真厉害
Boy, you're good.

211
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:39,170
道上的确都是这么传的
That is the word on the street, dear.

212
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:45,260
也许搬进来并不是个好主意
Maybe moving in was a bad idea.

213
00:10:45,420 --> 00:10:47,430
我屁股还没坐热  就已经开始制造麻烦了
I haven't been here one day, I'm already causing problems.

214
00:10:47,590 --> 00:10:49,930
这不是你的错  都怪谢尔顿
You didn't do anything. It's Sheldon.

215
00:10:50,090 --> 00:10:51,260
"这不是你的错  都怪谢尔顿"
"You didn't do anything. It's Sheldon."

216
00:10:51,430 --> 00:10:53,770
这句话太适合绣在靠垫上了
That'd make a nice needlepoint pillow.

217
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:57,440
放轻松  我们很欢迎你来住
So, relax. We're happy to have you.

218
00:10:57,810 --> 00:11:00,270
多谢  不过我怎么知道你不是为了安慰我才这么说的呢
Thank you, but how do I know you're not saying that just to be nice?

219
00:11:00,770 --> 00:11:01,940
你怎么花钱剪了个狗啃似的发型
Do you actually pay for that haircut?

220
00:11:02,110 --> 00:11:03,360
现在我知道了
That'll do it.

221
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:08,280
拉杰  我欠你一个道歉
Hey, Raj, I owe you an apology.

222
00:11:08,700 --> 00:11:10,620
你能给你那狗拴个绳子吗
Look, could you please put your dog on a leash?

223
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,990
谢尔顿  我这狗不咬人
Sheldon, she's fine.

224
00:11:13,490 --> 00:11:15,660
那你把她抱紧了  我好假装她是个动物标本
Well, then at least hold her still so I can pretend she's stuffed.

225
00:11:17,370 --> 00:11:22,630
拉杰  我一时没控制住自己的情绪  乱拿你来出气
Raj, I let my emotions get the best of me,and I unfairly took it out on you.

226
00:11:23,170 --> 00:11:24,460
谢谢  谢谢你这么说
Thank you. I appreciate that.

227
00:11:24,800 --> 00:11:25,880
不  功劳不在我身上
No, I can't take all the credit.

228
00:11:26,050 --> 00:11:28,720
我和莱纳德的妈妈聊了聊  她开解了我
I spoke with Leonard's mother, and she made me feel better.

229
00:11:28,970 --> 00:11:31,760
我不知道你和谁聊了  但会开解人的一定不是我妈
I don't know who you talked to, but that wasn't my mother.

230
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:39,480
贝弗利指出我在和艾米的恋爱关系中
Beverly pointed out that I'm experiencing insecurities

231
00:11:39,640 --> 00:11:42,230
存在不安全感  就像莱纳德和佩妮也存在同样的问题
in my relationship with Amy,in the same way that Leonard and Penny are in their relationship.

232
00:11:43,860 --> 00:11:45,650
你在乱说什么呀  我们俩好着呢
What are you talking about? We're fine.

233
00:11:46,230 --> 00:11:48,740
你俩好着的前提是有一个缓冲人同住
Yes, you're fine as long as you have a buffer living with you

234
00:11:48,900 --> 00:11:50,490
才能帮你们转移婚姻中出现的问题
to distract from your marital problems.

235
00:11:50,820 --> 00:11:54,330
从前我就是那个缓冲人  现在轮到拉杰和他的攻击性毛毛球了
It used to be me.Now it's Raj and his attack Tribble.

236
00:11:50,820 --> 00:11:54,330
《星际迷航》中的外星毛绒生物

237
00:11:57,160 --> 00:11:59,000
总之  我很抱歉
Anyway, I'm sorry for everything.

238
00:11:59,410 --> 00:12:01,790
顺带一提  如果他们吵架时你哇哇大哭
Oh, and FYI-- if you cry while they're fighting,

239
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:03,040
他们就会带你去麦当劳
they'll take you to McDonald's.

240
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:11,680
你好  莱纳德
Hello, Leonard.

241
00:12:12,180 --> 00:12:14,220
你为什么说我们有婚姻问题呀
Why are you saying we have marital problems?

242
00:12:14,390 --> 00:12:16,010
我们才没有婚姻问题呢
We don't have marital problems!

243
00:12:16,510 --> 00:12:19,640
我懂了  那你是因为太过幸福美满才对我哇哇叫
I see. You must be yelling at me out of wedded bliss.

244
00:12:23,230 --> 00:12:25,020
就因为我们收留朋友来住
Look, just because we took our friend in

245
00:12:25,190 --> 00:12:27,860
并不代表我和佩妮害怕两人独处
does not mean that Penny and I are afraid to be alone.

246
00:12:28,070 --> 00:12:30,650
没错  这次是特殊情况
Yeah, this is a special circumstance.

247
00:12:30,820 --> 00:12:34,280
谢尔顿提到你也曾想让你哥哥住到家里来
Sheldon mentioned you tried to get your brother to live with you, as well.

248
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:38,450
是啊  有些情况就算发生两次仍然可以算作特殊
Yeah, well, a circumstance can happen twice and still be special.

249
00:12:40,620 --> 00:12:41,620
你同意吗
Do you agree with that?

250
00:12:42,330 --> 00:12:43,710
现在你这么指出来...
Well, now that you point it out...

251
00:12:43,880 --> 00:12:45,630
你疯了吧
Are you kidding me?

252
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:47,880
我们好像真的一直在找新室友
We do seem to keep finding roommates.

253
00:12:48,050 --> 00:12:49,710
你现在和她站一边了吗
Now you're taking her side?

254
00:12:49,880 --> 00:12:52,970
亲爱的  我永远不会夹在你和莱纳德之间
Dear, I would never come between you and Leonard.

255
00:12:53,130 --> 00:12:55,800
这是你们一加强连室友的工作
That's for your parade of roommates to do.

256
00:12:59,890 --> 00:13:01,020
霍华德
Howard?

257
00:13:03,190 --> 00:13:04,190
霍华德
Howard!

258
00:13:05,980 --> 00:13:08,400
是我  是我呀
It's me! It's just me!

259
00:13:08,570 --> 00:13:10,650
你跑到我们卧室来干嘛
What are you doing here?!

260
00:13:11,070 --> 00:13:13,490
人家给你发了短信  可你没有回复
Well, I texted you, but you didn't respond.

261
00:13:13,650 --> 00:13:15,200
莱纳德和佩妮在吵架...
Leonard and Penny were arguing...

262
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:16,450
本大爷在此  谁敢撒野
Not on my watch!

263
00:13:19,450 --> 00:13:21,040
没事了  是拉杰
It's fine. It's just Raj.

264
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:23,160
我不介意你拿球棒敲死他  但我们没事
You can hit him with the bat, but it's fine.

265
00:13:24,710 --> 00:13:26,420
如果我心跳停止了  请让我放弃治疗
And if my heart stops, just let me go.

266
00:13:27,590 --> 00:13:28,750
抱歉了各位
I'm sorry, guys.

267
00:13:28,920 --> 00:13:31,460
谢尔顿在生气  莱纳德和佩妮在吵架
Sheldon was upset, Leonard and Penny were fighting.

268
00:13:31,630 --> 00:13:34,590
我只想待在一个不会造成别人问题的地方
I just wanted to go someplace where I wasn't causing problems.

269
00:13:34,760 --> 00:13:36,340
我要再说一次
I'll say it again.

270
00:13:37,050 --> 00:13:38,180
你老家印度
India.

271
00:13:42,390 --> 00:13:43,980
能让我住在车库吗
Can I just stay in the garage?

272
00:13:44,140 --> 00:13:45,940
别这样  今晚你先睡沙发吧
Don't do that. We'll make up the couch for you

273
00:13:46,100 --> 00:13:47,480
明早起来再想办法
and figure out something in the morning.

274
00:13:47,690 --> 00:13:49,360
-谢谢  -来吧
-Thank you.  -Come on,

275
00:13:49,520 --> 00:13:50,980
我帮你铺上床单  然后再测测
I'll get you some sheets. Then we'll see

276
00:13:51,150 --> 00:13:53,400
我的血压是不是冲上新高了
if I can beat my high score on the blood pressure machine.

277
00:13:58,280 --> 00:14:00,830
咱们就不该把这些熊孩子留在身边
Never should've had all these kids so close together.

278
00:14:12,800 --> 00:14:13,800
你没事吧
You okay?

279
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:16,050
我睡不着
I can't sleep.

280
00:14:17,680 --> 00:14:18,680
怎么了
What's wrong?

281
00:14:19,890 --> 00:14:24,600
贝弗利觉得我潜意识中把我的旧房间当做一个逃生出口
Beverly believes I unconsciously consider my old room an escape hatch.

282
00:14:25,310 --> 00:14:26,640
你在为这件事烦恼吗
Is that bothering you?

283
00:14:27,270 --> 00:14:30,150
没错  我才不喜欢什么潜意识呢
Yes. I don't care for unconscious thoughts.

284
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:33,400
人家和大脑是一辈子的好朋友  它什么事都会告诉我
My brain and I are best friends. It should tell me everything.

285
00:14:35,110 --> 00:14:37,410
我是说和我们恋情的关系
I mean, how it relates to our relationship,

286
00:14:37,570 --> 00:14:39,990
不是你和你大脑的兄弟浪漫史
not the bromance between you and your brain.

287
00:14:42,160 --> 00:14:43,740
万一她是对的呢
What if she's correct?

288
00:14:44,330 --> 00:14:46,250
就是说我俩之间有问题吗
Doesn't that say something troubling about us?

289
00:14:47,330 --> 00:14:50,290
我不知道  我只是觉得你是喜欢安排好
I don't know. I just think you're the kind of person

290
00:14:50,460 --> 00:14:52,550
应急计划的人
who likes a contingency plan.

291
00:14:54,210 --> 00:14:55,420
这倒是
That is true.

292
00:14:56,220 --> 00:14:57,760
你知道吗
Did you know I figured out

293
00:14:57,930 --> 00:15:01,640
我已经想清楚了  世界末日来临后  我会按什么顺序吃掉所有朋友
in which order I would eat all my friends in the event of an apocalypse?

294
00:15:05,140 --> 00:15:07,020
你不可以再和你的大脑整天混在一起了
You need to stop hanging out with your brain so much.

295
00:15:07,180 --> 00:15:08,390
它就是个坏朋友
It's not a good influence.

296
00:15:12,940 --> 00:15:15,360
如果你是想找零钱  我已经扫荡干净了
If you're looking for spare change,I already cleaned it out.

297
00:15:18,610 --> 00:15:22,160
没想到我的人生会变成这样
Didn't think this is where my life would be.

298
00:15:22,700 --> 00:15:25,620
我也是  我有卧室你睡沙发
Me, either.I'm in a bedroom and you're on a couch.

299
00:15:25,790 --> 00:15:27,040
我居然是赢家
I'm actually winning.

300
00:15:29,040 --> 00:15:30,170
咱俩都正走霉运
You know, we're both down on our luck.

301
00:15:30,330 --> 00:15:32,080
也许我俩应该找地方一起住
Maybe you and I should try to get a place together.

302
00:15:32,340 --> 00:15:34,300
听我说
Okay, listen to me.

303
00:15:36,760 --> 00:15:40,380
根本没有离开这里的理由
There is no reason to leave here.

304
00:15:40,550 --> 00:15:43,970
这里很棒  所有人都很友好  非常舒服
This is great. Everyone's nice.It's comfortable.

305
00:15:44,140 --> 00:15:46,560
如果一切按计划进行  这里就是我的养老院了
If all goes according to plan, this is my retirement home.

306
00:15:47,890 --> 00:15:50,520
如果你更加独立的话  不会自我感觉更好一些吗
Wouldn't you feel better about yourself if you were more independent?

307
00:15:50,900 --> 00:15:53,900
比在他们家蒸汽淋浴里的感觉更好吗  我觉得不会
Better than I feel in their steam shower? I don't think so.

308
00:15:56,690 --> 00:15:58,280
佩妮是主菜
Penny would be the entree.

309
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:03,490
莱纳德算是奶酪盘
Then Leonard's basically a cheese course.

310
00:16:04,490 --> 00:16:07,790
因为我爱你  所以你是甜点
And because I love you, you're dessert.

311
00:16:09,210 --> 00:16:12,290
我也想说"好甜蜜" 但我要说"好恶心"
I want to say "Aw," but I'm gonna say "Ew."

312
00:16:14,880 --> 00:16:17,920
不  我这样做  我就不再是被宠坏的孩子了
No, you see, I'm doing this so I can stop being spoiled

313
00:16:18,090 --> 00:16:21,090
成长为一个成年人
and,you know,grow as a person.

314
00:16:21,590 --> 00:16:22,680
好样的
Good for you.

315
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:25,550
这个三明治里有价值6块钱的火腿
This sandwich has six dollars worth of ham in it.

316
00:16:29,060 --> 00:16:31,940
你在朋友家吃白食  你一点点内疚感都没有吗
Don't you even feel a little bad sponging off your friends?

317
00:16:32,900 --> 00:16:35,150
我上过艺术学院
Hey, look, I went to art college,

318
00:16:35,310 --> 00:16:36,770
我想成为美术设计师
I tried to make it as a graphic artist,

319
00:16:37,530 --> 00:16:38,530
漫画家
a comic book artist,

320
00:16:38,690 --> 00:16:40,150
知道我努力得到了什么吗
and you know what I got for my efforts?

321
00:16:40,320 --> 00:16:41,650
瘦骨嶙峋
A visible rib cage.

322
00:16:43,860 --> 00:16:46,030
我没开玩笑  你可以看到我的心跳
I'm not kidding. You could see my heart beating.

323
00:16:47,410 --> 00:16:49,330
无意冒犯  但我没上过艺术学院
Well, no offense, but I didn't go to art school.

324
00:16:49,500 --> 00:16:51,120
我有天体物理学的博士学位
I have a PhD in astrophysics.

325
00:16:51,830 --> 00:16:53,120
很好  流落街头时
Oh, great, it'll be easier for you

326
00:16:53,290 --> 00:16:55,750
头上没有屋顶  你观星更容易
to look up at the stars without a roof over your head.

327
00:16:59,340 --> 00:17:00,340
早
Morning.

328
00:17:00,510 --> 00:17:02,630
你知道拉杰昨晚搬出去了吗
Did you know Raj moved out last night?

329
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:03,840
什么  为什么
What? Why?

330
00:17:04,050 --> 00:17:06,510
"莱纳德和佩妮  抱歉我带来了这么多麻烦
"Leonard and Penny, I'm sorry for all the trouble I've caused.

331
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:07,890
我去霍华德家住
I went to stay at Howard's.

332
00:17:08,390 --> 00:17:09,810
另外  小桂子和我在一起
P.S., Cinnamon's with me,

333
00:17:09,970 --> 00:17:11,560
但如果你们想耍谢尔顿
But if you feel like messing with Sheldon,

334
00:17:11,730 --> 00:17:13,940
就告诉他  小桂子在楼里走丢了"
tell him she's loose in the building."

335
00:17:16,900 --> 00:17:18,190
感觉好糟糕啊
I feel terrible.

336
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:19,480
我们要接他回来吗
Should we go bring him back?

337
00:17:19,650 --> 00:17:20,690
是你担心有室友
Well, you're the one worried

338
00:17:20,860 --> 00:17:22,950
是我们婚姻有问题的表现
having someone live with us is a sign of problems.

339
00:17:23,700 --> 00:17:26,070
那只是因为我妈让我有了这种想法
Oh, that was just because my mother got in my head.

340
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:27,660
就好像恶魔上身了
It's like being possessed,

341
00:17:27,830 --> 00:17:30,790
但上身的不是恶魔而是...其实没差别啦
but instead of Satan, it's...Actually, it's the same thing.

342
00:17:33,080 --> 00:17:35,330
好的  那我们叫他回来
All right, so we'll ask him to come back.

343
00:17:35,790 --> 00:17:36,830
很好
Well, great.

344
00:17:37,840 --> 00:17:39,090
你不先换衣服吗
Don't you want to get dressed first?

345
00:17:39,250 --> 00:17:40,500
稍等
Just one second.

346
00:17:47,010 --> 00:17:49,850
救命  小桂子在楼里走丢了
Help! Cinnamon's loose in the building!

347
00:17:51,220 --> 00:17:53,270
艾米  快  锁门
Amy, quick, lock the door!

348
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:59,650
如果我们让你难受真是抱歉
We're so sorry if we made you feel uncomfortable.

349
00:17:59,820 --> 00:18:01,110
我们吵架真不是因为你
We really weren't fighting about you.

350
00:18:01,480 --> 00:18:03,400
我只是不想成为朋友的负担
I just never want to be a burden on my friends.

351
00:18:03,860 --> 00:18:05,150
我也是  不想成为负担
Me, either. Don't want to be a burden.

352
00:18:05,320 --> 00:18:06,860
是孩子的声音吗  我去看看
Hey, is that the baby? I'll go check.

353
00:18:09,030 --> 00:18:10,200
你不是负担
You are not a burden,

354
00:18:10,370 --> 00:18:12,040
我们希望你回来一起住
and we want you to come back and stay with us.

355
00:18:12,370 --> 00:18:13,500
但我让谢尔顿不高兴
But I also upset Sheldon,

356
00:18:13,660 --> 00:18:15,870
如果我住在那里  他不会去你们家的
and he's not gonna want to come over if I'm there.

357
00:18:16,170 --> 00:18:17,790
这是你更应该来住的原因
More reasons for you to stay.

358
00:18:20,840 --> 00:18:21,840
哈雷没事
Halley's fine.

359
00:18:22,340 --> 00:18:24,220
你知道她在我父母家呢吧
You know she's at my parents' house, right?

360
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:29,220
她正享受着人生中最美好的时光
And she's having the time of her life.

361
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:34,770
如果你想改变一下  我家随时欢迎你
If you ever want to change things up,you're always welcome here.

362
00:18:35,270 --> 00:18:37,230
别来我们卧室就成  白痴
Just not in our bedroom, you dumbass.

363
00:18:40,520 --> 00:18:42,230
非常感谢
I appreciate it,

364
00:18:42,400 --> 00:18:45,610
但我想住莱纳德和佩妮家  对大家都更有利
but I think staying with Leonard and Penny makes more sense for everyone.

365
00:18:45,780 --> 00:18:46,820
就这么定了
Then it's settled.

366
00:18:46,990 --> 00:18:50,240
告诉你一声  这只是暂时的  我不会太给方便就随便的
And just so you know,it's only temporary.I'm not gonna get too comfortable.

367
00:18:50,830 --> 00:18:54,410
很好  谁家都不想要一个吃一辈子白食的人
Good.Nobody needs a mooch living in their house forever.

368
00:18:54,580 --> 00:18:56,580
这样说你家宝宝可不好
Hey, that's no way to talk about your baby.

369
00:19:05,800 --> 00:19:08,050
知道吗  我为我们感到骄傲
You know what? I'm proud of us.

370
00:19:08,220 --> 00:19:10,720
佩妮和莱纳德收留了拉杰
Yeah, with Penny and Leonard taking in Raj,

371
00:19:10,890 --> 00:19:13,010
斯图尔特住在霍华德和伯纳黛特家
and Stuart living with Howard and Bernadette,

372
00:19:13,180 --> 00:19:15,270
我们是这个小团队中唯一一对
we're the only couple of our social group

373
00:19:15,430 --> 00:19:18,810
不需要用第三者填补关系中大坑的人
who doesn't need to fill the holes in their relationship with a third party.

374
00:19:19,690 --> 00:19:20,690
对  我们完胜
Yup, we're killin' it.

